      "content": "WARNING: DISCONNECT  THE  INFUSER  FROM  AC  POWER  PRIOR  TO CLEANING  THE  DEVICE.  FAILURE  TO  COMPLY  WITH  THIS WARNING COULD RESULT IN ELECTRICAL SHOCK.",
